      "x": 25,
      "y": 15,
      "dx": -1,
      "dy": 0,
      "title": "SICK LIST",
      "text": "Week three: fourteen men sick. Cold hands, no appetite, no sleep. Four men reported dead at reveille have since returned to duty. The medical officer declines to explain this, and has asked to be sent to the front."
